cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
  A peer-reviewed article describing this work is currently in
  preparation; citation details will be added here once published.
title: "EPW Insights"
abstract: >-
  A browser-based, fully client-side tool for analyzing EnergyPlus
  Weather (EPW) files. Provides psychrometric charts, outdoor thermal
  comfort analysis (UTCI, SET), material and thermal mass analysis,
  and future climate projections using the CMIP6/IPCC AR6 morphing
  method, with no server-side processing.
